'''Odahviing''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon|Dragon]] that becomes your ally as part of the [[Skyrim:The Fallen|main quest]]. He can be summoned with the [[Skyrim:Call Dragon|Call Dragon]] shout only while you're outdoors. This shout is simply his name, Od-Ah-Viing, Snow-Hunter-Wing. He can be seen flying around [[Skyrim:Throat of the World|the Throat of the World]], awaiting your call, once the main quest is complete. He can be very useful at any level as he is [[Skyrim:Essential Creatures|impossible to kill]] and won't leave you until all nearby enemies are dead. He uses the [[Skyrim:Fire Breath|Fire Breath]] shout and standard dragon melee attacks as his weapons.
{{NewLeft}}

